{"s":110,"v":[{"t":"When the victory of Allāh has come and the conquest,","w":[["إِذَا","When","idhā",""],["جَآءَ","comes","jāa",""],["نَصْرُ","(the) Help","naṣru",""],["ٱللَّهِ","(of) Allah","l-lahi",""],["وَٱلْفَتْحُ","and the Victory","wal-fatḥu","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلْ",2],["فَتْحُ",734]]]]},{"t":"And you see the people entering into the religion of Allāh in multitudes,","w":[["وَرَأَيْتَ","And you see","wara-ayta","",[["وَ",1],["رَأَيْ",60],["تَ",18]]],["ٱلنَّاسَ","the people","l-nāsa","",[["ٱل",2],["نَّاسَ",67]]],["يَدْخُلُونَ","entering","yadkhulūna","",[["يَدْخُلُ",164],["ونَ",3]]],["فِى","into","fī",""],["دِينِ","(the) religion","dīni",""],["ٱللَّهِ","(of) Allah","l-lahi",""],["أَفْوَاجًۭا","(in) multitudes","afwājan",""]]},{"t":"Then exalt [Him] with praise of your Lord and ask forgiveness of Him. Indeed, He is ever Accepting of Repentance.","w":[["فَسَبِّحْ","Then glorify","fasabbiḥ","",[["فَ",7],["سَبِّحْ",288]]],["بِحَمْدِ","with (the) praises","biḥamdi","",[["بِ",10],["حَمْدِ",282]]],["رَبِّكَ","(of) your Lord","rabbika","",[["رَبِّ",24],["كَ",18]]],["وَٱسْتَغْفِرْهُ","and ask His forgiveness","wa-is'taghfir'hu","ۚ",[["وَ",1],["ٱسْتَغْفِرْ",299],["هُ",5]]],["إِنَّهُۥ","Indeed, He","innahu","",[["إِنَّ",15],["هُۥ",5]]],["كَانَ","is","kāna",""],["تَوَّابًۢا","Oft-Returning","tawwāban",""]]}]}